From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <sysretq0@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 04:10:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: Add MediaTek MT6789 JPEG encoder compatible

Add the mediatek,mt6789-jpgenc compatible string (falling back to
mediatek,mtk-jpgenc) for the MediaTek MT6789 hardware JPEG encoder on
VENCSYS / LARB7.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <sysretq0@proton.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/mediatek-jpeg-encoder.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/mediatek-jpeg-encoder.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/mediatek-jpeg-encoder.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/mediatek-jpeg-encoder.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/mediatek-jpeg-encoder.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - mediatek,mt2701-jpgenc
+              - mediatek,mt6789-jpgenc
               - mediatek,mt8183-jpgenc
               - mediatek,mt8186-jpgenc
               - mediatek,mt8188-jpgenc
-- 
